     "name": "What does the apartment cost per month?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "The broker has not published a rent. Five-room units in Ramat Aviv HaHadasha and Ramat Aviv Gimel are offered at NIS 12,800 to 18,000 a month, and a building with a pool adds a building fee of about NIS 1,700 to 2,300, based on examples nearby."
